  "details": "At one point during a meetup an avatar that hadn't been updated in over a month (avtr_6ce8201a-cd01-4b79-bd5d-17b00d0cea52) suddenly lost the ability to randomize. Every time it was called it would return the exact same set of values (which were not the default or last values, but one specific set of random values), even if someone else in the instance was using it or the avatar was fully reset or the person left the instance and returned each person would randomize to the exact same values every time.\n\nTesting another avatar that uses the Parameter Driver also showed that it too would default to a set of randomized values.\n\nFor about 40 minutes the ability to randomize was seemingly broken in the world, before it spontaneously fixed itself.\n\nThe specific instance in which it happened https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_033b9f75-49be-4213-9218-a540dd2be60a&instanceId=33795~group(grp_e68ff454-16ad-44f5-be65-aff2c44c8cb7)~groupAccessType(plus)~region(us)&shortName=4hbrnrb0",
